            <div xml:id="d494">

                <pb facs="0635" n="533" sameAs="frus:frus1919v01/pg533"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.51/2520: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Vice President of the Continental &amp; Commercial
                        Trust &amp; Sowings Bank of Chicago</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Abbott</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Chicago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-11-01"><hi rendition="#italic">November 1,
                            1919</hi></date>.<lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received November 1, 3.01
                            p.m.</hi>]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Your telegram October 31st received this a.m. We accede to your request and will
                    postpone at least temporarily the confirmation by our executive committee of
                    loan contract of October 20 and proceed only to issue smaller loan contracted
                    under agreement of October 11 for the redemption of funds maturing to-day.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Jno. J. Abbott</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
